Hello <%= @resource.email %>,

Someone — hopefully you — asked to reset your BiteWorthy password.
Open the link below to choose a new one. It expires in 6 hours.

  <%= "#{ENV.fetch('MAILER_HOST', 'https://bite-worthy.com').chomp('/')}/reset-password?reset_password_token=#{@token}" %>

If you didn't ask for this, ignore this email — your password won't
change without the link being used.
